      "Language": "hun",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case is presented where coronarography was complicated by coronary embolism. The acute circulatory failure could be controlled only by intraaortic balloon pump therapy. The authors emphasize the importance of the mechanical circulatory support devices in the cardiac catheterization laboratories as well as at the coronary care units."},
